### ============================
### 库存管理测试
### ============================

### 登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}


### ============================
### 库存查询
### ============================

### 库存列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 库存列表（按关键字筛选）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/list?keyword=键盘
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 单品库存
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ============================
### 库存调整
### ============================

### 增加库存
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "changeQty": 20,
  "remark": "盘点增加"
}


### 减少库存
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "changeQty": -10,
  "remark": "盘点减少"
}


### 库存不足 → 40001
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/adjust
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "changeQty": -99999,
  "remark": "测试不足"
}


### ============================
### 库存流水
### ============================

### 查询商品1的流水
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/records?productId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 查询全部流水（按出库类型）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/records?type=OUTBOUND
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 查询全部流水（按入库类型）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/records?type=INBOUND
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
